[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471/) held every report about dates as one issue: the parser reads dates
month first. Read by tenant, and by what each report says, the reports show more than one bug.
Each one has a ticket of its own.

Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October: the parser fix shipped, and the booking-v3 form is retired.
That closes two of the problems. The one-day moves are still open.

